    "title": "Help",
    "subtitle": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "faq1Title": "What are My Services?",
    "faq1Body": "The Services section shows a list of your active configs. You can see usage status, expiry date, subscription link, and details for each service.",
    "faq2Title": "How do I renew a service?",
    "faq2Body": "Open the details page of any service and choose Renew. Your wallet balance must be sufficient. If enabled, auto-renew can also be configured from the same page.",
    "faq3Title": "Wallet top-up methods",
    "faq3Body": "Manual card-to-card (with receipt upload), automatic card-to-card (SMS verification), crypto payment (TRX/USDT/TON), and the Tetrapay gateway are available in the Wallet section. Active methods vary based on bot settings.",
    "faq4Title": "Buying a new service",
    "faq4Body": "From the Buy menu, choose your desired panel and plan. Your active discount (if any) is applied during checkout. After payment, the service is added to your services list.",
    "faq5Title": "Where can I see transactions?",
    "faq5Body": "The full history of deposits and payments is visible in the Wallet Transactions section. Each transaction's status (pending, approved, rejected) is also shown.",
    "faq6Title": "Signing in with a web account or OTP",
    "faq6Body": "If you're accessing this outside of Telegram, sign in with a username/password or your phone number and an OTP code. Inside the Telegram mini-app, a separate sign-in usually isn't needed."
  },
